  "post_content": "<p>(9 fotos) Este s&aacute;bado ha tenido lugar en Onda la celebraci&oacute;n del 100 cumplea&ntilde;os de Mar&iacute;a Irigaray G&oacute;mez, &#39;Maria, la de l&rsquo;estaci&oacute;&#39;. Un acto muy emotivo donde se han dado cita hijos, nietos, biznietos y tataranietos.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/01/DSC_0106.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>En el evento, esta incombustible mujer ha agradecido con su simpat&iacute;a habitual a los familiares que le brindaran tan emotivo acto.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/centenariamariairigaray/dsc_0067.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0067\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/centenariamariairigaray/dsc_0077.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0077\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/centenariamariairigaray/dsc_0081.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0081\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/centenariamariairigaray/dsc_0092.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0092\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/centenariamariairigaray/dsc_0092_0.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0092_0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/centenariamariairigaray/dsc_0095.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0095\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/centenariamariairigaray/dsc_0111.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0111\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/centenariamariairigaray/dsc_0115.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0115\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
